  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Cluster: New Sustainable Spices Origins</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to develop a sustainable production and processing base of spices in Madagascar and Tanzania, resulting in a spices chain benefitting local farmers and other stakeholders in the chain and on the other hand giving local producers a unique selling point towards the demand side.Local farmers will be trained on spice cultivation skills for better yields and better quality of production and next on post-harvest treatment, quality control and assurance.Given the high demands in the market, a higher yield will lead to higher revenues for farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
